cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use yocto in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "yocto: the tiny IoC container for .NET 10"
abstract: >-
  yocto is a free, open-source inversion-of-control (IoC) and dependency injection container for .NET 10.
  It is a drop-in IServiceProvider for Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection and ASP.NET Core, with keyed services,
  open generics, scopes, child containers, per-thread and pooled lifetimes, build-time validation, and Native AOT support.
